{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A fifth number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, is added to the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934b3a4f7db1dae2b8e2010e52b19adeb6f2b65d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 3,6,9,10 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> to make the mean of the set of five numbers equal to its median.  The number of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22c4e6084a262156cc43f53bc6805e4a4865be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{more than }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"413\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The mean of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a029baa87492bf64733ff0ea75b11535ad193df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{3, 6, 9, 10, n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/478c2cc693178ac25738091d8c7506ea5918d703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3+6+9+10+n}{5} = \\frac{28+n}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"231\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/3738f33a95957bd5bc39f63e1c1526aa82ccaafb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e07309d59de6e2d1ccd73cae9fb9cc52c07d3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28+n}{5} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598a16d4b7dde3dec3a390109882d54bb0308ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, which is valid since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1f634e03732a6820fb6311e685923a40d424a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/4025f4e3b1a347598ac1ac92a3a7051f8be99adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\leq n &lt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" />, the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.  Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adbdd01e2afe86e0226ea24acf66a901e4434927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28+n}{5} = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea0402efce9f2319988b2f404519983e0e8ff93e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 7$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, which is valid since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d98b7c69f0ee6e385744b41ab017a44ec1d204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\leq 7 &lt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/545cb201c2b28b17b453f6757b52fdb3b226b757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85a9bff58561790bb370759be2e36063085585f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28+n}{5} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b7341545d5484c6c86ae46c3edc15cf1f772613c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />, which is valid since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9c0355e3782e9d0c5f0030aef1dd00ba3b2561d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 \\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88676177603d4e7134e7819bb31db2c8ca62f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b>